From 8d4666271f1468301988fdd5916a5c82d2dafa9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anzhe Li <lianzhe1@h-partners.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 14:03:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ub:ubutils: Adding the device ID of the new chip version

driver inclusion
category: bugfix
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/ubutils/issues/6
CVE: NA

-----------------------------------------------------------

ubutils parses the device ID through ub.ids and converts it
into the corresponding name of the device. Therefore,
we update ub.ids to parse the device IDs of the new version
of the chip.

Signed-off-by: Anzhe Li <lianzhe1@h-partners.com>
---
 ub.ids | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ub.ids b/ub.ids
index 76aa615..9371bb2 100644
--- a/ub.ids
+++ b/ub.ids
@@ -16,6 +16,14 @@ cc08  Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd.
 	a005  PMU management ub entity
 	a006  PMU ub entity
 	a007  Master Ctrl entity
+	a00a  Bus controller
+	a00b  URMA management ub entity
+	a00c  URMA ub entity
+	a00d  CDMA management ub entity
+	a00e  CDMA ub entity
+	a00f  PMU management ub entity
+	a010  PMU ub entity
+	a011  Master Ctrl entity
 	d802  URMA management ub entity
 	d803  URMA ub entity
 	d804  CDMA management ub entity
@@ -27,6 +35,17 @@ cc08  Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd.
 	d80a  Bus controller
 	d80b  URMA UBoE management ub entity
 	d80c  URMA UBoE ub entity
+	d812  URMA management ub entity
+	d813  URMA ub entity
+	d814  CDMA management ub entity
+	d815  CDMA ub entity
+	d816  PMU management ub entity
+	d817  PMU ub entity
+	d818  CCU management ub entity
+	d819  CCU ub entity
+	d81a  Bus controller
+	d81b  URMA UBoE management ub entity
+	d81c  URMA UBoE ub entity
 	8200  SP500U Family management ub entity
 	8201  SP500U Family ub entity
 C 00  Bus controller
